Package: scenecutbatch
Version: 0.1.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, ffmpeg
Maintainer: JMW Studio <maintainer@scenecutbatch.com>
Description: Batch scene-cut detection that emits FCP7 XML (xmeml) with virtual subclips, importable by professional video editors.
 SceneCutBatch detects hard scene cuts across folders of video clips using
 PySceneDetect and emits FCP7 XML files with virtual subclips referencing the
 original media (no duplication).
